<div class="modal fade" id="activecollabConnectionModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered"><div class="modal-content"><form id="activecollabConnectionForm"><div class="modal-header"><h5 class="modal-title">Новое подключение ActiveCollab</h5><button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Закрыть"></button></div><div class="modal-body"><p class="text-muted small">Укажите полный HTTPS API root вашего облачного или self-hosted ActiveCollab, например <code>https://app.activecollab.com/ACCOUNT_ID/api/v1</code>, и Personal API Token. В зависимости от версии API root может заканчиваться на <code>/api/1.0</code>. Токен хранится зашифрованным.</p><label class="form-label">Название</label><input class="form-control mb-3" name="name" maxlength="255" required placeholder="Основной ActiveCollab"><label class="form-label">API root</label><input class="form-control mb-3" name="base_url" type="url" required placeholder="https://app.activecollab.com/123456/api/v1"><label class="form-label">Account ID</label><input class="form-control mb-3" name="account_id" required maxlength="191" placeholder="123456"><label class="form-label">Personal API Token</label><input class="form-control" name="access_token" type="password" required autocomplete="new-password"><div id="activecollabConnectionError" class="alert alert-danger d-none mt-3"></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn crm-btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Отмена</button><button class="btn crm-btn-primary" type="submit">Сохранить и проверить</button></div></form></div></div></div>
